          <caption>
            <p>Folliculitis Decalvans, H&#x00026;E &#x000d7;1000. This image shows dilatation of the follicular infundibulum. The follicular infundibulum and the isthmus are surrounded by a dense mixed inflammatory infiltrate, rich in neutrophils and plasma cells, with perifollicular fibrosis. (H&#x00026;E, &#x000d7;100, horizontal and vertical sections). Contributed by M Abdel-Halim Ibrahim, MD</p>
          </caption>
          <graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="Folliculitis__decalvans" position="float" orientation="portrait"/>
        </fig>
      </floats-group>
      <floats-group id="article-30675.s18">
        <fig id="article-30675.image.f2" position="float" orientation="portrait">
          <caption>
            <p>Acne Keloidalis Nuchae, Dermoscopy. This image shows acne keloidalis nuchae with hair tufts on dermoscopy. Contributed by HM Saleh, MD, PhD</p>
          </caption>
          <graphic xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="Acne__keloidalis__nuchae" position="float" orientation="portrait"/>
